silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_05_federation_olog_register_yoneda_hom_leg_register_to_object silm:hasExample "In 'RegisterToTypedObjectArrow', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, FedReg_Mittens -> {VetRecord_Mittens, StoragePacket_Mittens, KGAssertion_Mittens, CatalogTrace_Mittens}" .
